        "answer": {
          "short": "Domain: $x\\in[0,10]$; range: $y\\in[-5,5]$.",
          "worked": "The centre is $(5,0)$ and the radius is $5$.\n$$\\begin{align*}5-5&=0\\\\5+5&=10\\\\0-5&=-5\\\\0+5&=5\\end{align*}$$\nDomain: $x\\in[0,10]$. Range: $y\\in[-5,5]$.",
